1
00:00:00,080 --> 00:00:03,467
Omar: Floor four. Mrs. Lin lives here.

2
00:00:04,137 --> 00:00:08,304
ALDER TOWER INTERCOM: The Last Floor. Part
two of three: the stairs.

3
00:00:08,624 --> 00:00:11,968
Mrs. Lin: Pip! There you are! Who locked
my stairs?

4
00:00:12,638 --> 00:00:13,982
Bell: I did. Rule one.

5
00:00:14,102 --> 00:00:14,666
Mrs. Lin: ...Fair.

6
00:00:15,336 --> 00:00:17,617
Bell: Go up. Seal the door behind you.

7
00:00:18,287 --> 00:00:24,392
Omar: Floor four, five, six... that's a
lot of floors.

8
00:00:24,512 --> 00:00:26,377
Zara: Keep climbing. Don't count.

9
00:00:27,047 --> 00:00:29,950
Zara: Floor five. The stairs are blocked!

10
00:00:30,620 --> 00:00:32,589
Bell: Push! Everyone push!

11
00:00:33,259 --> 00:00:33,886
Zara: ...Direct hit.

12
00:00:34,859 --> 00:00:37,985
Mrs. Lin: That's my sister's flat. She
says never open it.

13
00:00:38,655 --> 00:00:40,662
Mrs. Lin: Dot, you're not well.

14
00:00:41,332 --> 00:00:43,093
Bell: Leave her. Lock the door.

15
00:00:43,763 --> 00:00:45,525
Mrs. Lin: Goodbye, Dot. Click.

16
00:00:46,195 --> 00:00:48,464
Zara: They're gaining. Floor seven.

17
00:00:49,134 --> 00:00:52,112
Omar: Twelve floors. My legs filed a
complaint.

18
00:00:52,782 --> 00:00:55,026
Bell: Shortcut! Through the floor ten
hall!

19
00:00:55,696 --> 00:01:02,692
ALDER TOWER INTERCOM: Part two of three, The
Last Floor. Next: the roof. Follow for part three.

